# Bennett Furina Fischl Ineffa. ~20s Rot. Overvape Thundering Fury Bennett with Furina. Bennett spams N2C and tE off CD. Fischl alternates skill and burst in Bennett field. CW instead of TF may increases Bennett damage at the cost of Furina's ER req.
# WIP. Bennett: Exaiphanes Blade? Heretic's Molten Blade? Emberwell? Fischl: Jade Vista? Furina: CW ER? Ineffa: Burst every rot?

